1
00:00:00,766 --> 00:00:02,766
(Sheldon:)this is a thermostat.

2
00:00:02,768 --> 00:00:06,008
(Sheldon:)It controls the temperature
of the apartment.

3
00:00:07,039 --> 00:00:09,739
(Sheldon:)The ideal setting is 72 degrees.

4
00:00:09,742 --> 00:00:12,772
(Sheldon:)If you find this too cold,
then put on a jacket.

5
00:00:12,778 --> 00:00:16,618
(Sheldon:)A straitjacket, 'cause 72's
the best and you're crazy.

6
00:00:17,483 --> 00:00:19,653
(Sheldon:)Now... this...

7
00:00:19,651 --> 00:00:21,521
(Sheldon:)is your spot.

8
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:23,750
(Sheldon:)You're very protective of it.

9
00:00:23,756 --> 00:00:25,726
(Sheldon:)When anyone else tries
to sit here,

10
00:00:25,724 --> 00:00:27,654
(Sheldon:)you berate them relentlessly.

11
00:00:27,659 --> 00:00:31,359
(Sheldon:)It sounds mean, but
somehow you make it adorable.

12
00:00:33,098 --> 00:00:35,998
(Sheldon:)People are also delighted
by your love of pranks.

13
00:00:37,136 --> 00:00:39,636
(quietly):
For example, Leonard has no idea

14
00:00:39,638 --> 00:00:41,108
(Sheldon:)what I did to his coffee.

15
00:00:43,242 --> 00:00:45,372
It wasn't "replace it
with Folger's crystals,"

16
00:00:45,377 --> 00:00:47,407
(Sheldon:)I'll tell you that much.

17
00:00:47,413 --> 00:00:50,043
(Leonard:)Hey, can we please
get back to work?

18
00:00:50,049 --> 00:00:51,749
(Sheldon:)This is Leonard.

19
00:00:51,750 --> 00:00:53,580
(Sheldon:)He's your best friend
in the world.

20
00:00:53,585 --> 00:00:55,985
(Leonard:)All right, just stop.
This is ridiculous.

21
00:00:57,556 --> 00:01:00,056
(Sheldon:)Sometimes he gets cranky,

